MACRO                                                                           
* *                                                                             
* *    W W D C L A N D                                                          
* *                                                                             
* *    U S A G E : INSTREAM TABLE IS DEFINED BELOW THAT CAN BE USED             
* *                TO SEARCH FOR A DC AND ITS MAPPING COUNTRY CODE.             
* *                ALSO HAS CONSTANTS DEFINED FOR COUNTRY CODES.                
* *                                                                             
* *                ADD THE FOLLOWING STATEMENT IN WORKING STORAGE               
* *                  %WWDCLAND                                                  
* *                                                                             
* *                TO SEARCH, USE BELOW WITHIN A JOB.                           
* *                  SEARCH WWDCLAND WITH <DC> GIVING <IDLANDX2>                
* *                  IF WWDCLAND                                                
* *                    .. DO WHAT NEEDS TO BE DONE WHEN THERE IS A HIT          
* *                  ELSE                                                       
* *                    .. DO WHAT NEEDS TO BE DONE WHEN THERE IS NO HIT         
* *                  END-IF                                                     
* *                                                                             
FILE WWDCLAND TABLE INSTREAM                                                    
  ARG  1 2 A                                                                    
  DESC 4 2 A                                                                    
11 SE                                                                           
12 NL                                                                           
40 US                                                                           
41 US                                                                           
43 US                                                                           
44 US                                                                           
45 US                                                                           
46 US                                                                           
47 US                                                                           
51 CA                                                                           
52 BR                                                                           
53 MX                                                                           
6A JP                                                                           
61 JP                                                                           
62 AU                                                                           
63 TH                                                                           
64 TW                                                                           
65 KR                                                                           
66 MY                                                                           
67 IN                                                                           
70 CN                                                                           
71 CN                                                                           
72 CN                                                                           
73 CN                                                                           
74 CN                                                                           
81 RU                                                                           
85 ZA                                                                           
86 TR                                                                           
87 AE                                                                           
92 US                                                                           
93 TH                                                                           
ENDTABLE                                                                        
                                                                                
 DEFINE DCLAND-ARABEMIRATES             W 2 A VALUE 'AE'                        
 DEFINE DCLAND-AUSTRALIA                W 2 A VALUE 'AU'                        
 DEFINE DCLAND-CANADA                   W 2 A VALUE 'CA'                        
 DEFINE DCLAND-CHINA                    W 2 A VALUE 'CN'                        
 DEFINE DCLAND-INDIA                    W 2 A VALUE 'IN'                        
 DEFINE DCLAND-JAPAN                    W 2 A VALUE 'JP'                        
 DEFINE DCLAND-KOREA                    W 2 A VALUE 'KR'                        
 DEFINE DCLAND-MALAYSIA                 W 2 A VALUE 'MY'                        
 DEFINE DCLAND-HOLLAND-TR               W 2 A VALUE 'NL'                        
 DEFINE DCLAND-RUSSIA                   W 2 A VALUE 'RU'                        
 DEFINE DCLAND-SWEDEN                   W 2 A VALUE 'SE'                        
 DEFINE DCLAND-THAILAND                 W 2 A VALUE 'TH'                        
 DEFINE DCLAND-TAIWAN                   W 2 A VALUE 'TW'                        
 DEFINE DCLAND-USA                      W 2 A VALUE 'US'                        
MEND                                                                            
* *   W W D C L A N D    E N D S                                                
